<h1>Copy as Transformation</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This command is accessible from the <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>tree context menu</b></span> <span class="Path">for</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Current CS &gt; Copy as Transformation</b></span>.</p>
<p class="Description"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span></b> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Command">Copy as Transformation</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command c</span>reates a copy of Current CS in Transformations group.</p>
<p class="Use">This command is shortcut of the combination of <a href="copy.htm">Copy</a> and <a href="Paste_as_New_Entity.htm">Paste as New Entity</a> commands.</p>
